{"sourceUrl":"http://www.chem.bnu.edu.cn/rcpy/yjs/yjszxxx/3cc74d5cb9ba48a5ab476525204ad19f.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:19:50.036439+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://www.chem.bnu.edu.cn/rcpy/yjs/yjszxxx/3cc74d5cb9ba48a5ab476525204ad19f.htm","html":"<div>\n<div>\n<p><span>北京师范大学</span><span>2027</span><span>年接收校内外推荐免试硕士</span><span>/</span><span>博士研究生的申请工作已经开始，请关注学校研究生招生网（</span><span>https://yz.bnu.edu.cn/</span><span>），认真阅读</span><span>北京师范大学</span><span>2027</span><span>年推荐免试硕士</span><span>/</span><span>博士研究生招生录取工作办法</span><span>（</span><span>https://yz.bnu.edu.cn/detail/be0e6268-0bfd-4a34-aa31-e72207bf2577</span><span>），查看申请条件、申请程序等。</span></p>\n<p><span>化学学院接收校内外推荐免试硕士</span><span>/</span><span>博士研究生工作日程安排如下：</span></p>\n<p><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>2</span><span>日</span><span>-11</span><span>日</span></p>\n<p><span>考生于</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>11</span><span>日</span><span>23:00</span><span>前，登录北京师范大学</span><span>2027</span><span>年推免申请系统进行申请（</span><span>https://yzh.bnu.edu.cn/www/tm/xs/login</span><span>）；按要求将电子版材料上传到系统（相关要求请见推免申请系统），同时将电子版材料按照</span><span>“</span><span>申请表</span><span>+</span><span>成绩单</span><span>+</span><span>个人自述</span><span>+</span><span>外语水平证明</span><span>+</span><span>获奖证书</span><span>+</span><span>发表论</span><span>文+诚信承诺书+其他材料”的顺</span><span>序整理合并为一个</span><span>pdf</span><span>文件，命名为</span><span>“</span><span>二级学科</span><span>+</span><span>硕士</span><span>/</span><span>直博</span><span>+</span><span>姓名</span><span>”</span><span>，例如</span><span>“</span><span>无机化学</span><span>+</span><span>直博</span><span>+</span><span>张三</span><span>”</span><span>，发到邮箱</span><span>hxyjs@bnu.edu.cn</span><span>，邮件主题为</span><span>“</span><span>二级学科</span><span>+</span><span>直博</span><span>/</span><span>硕士</span><span>+</span><span>姓名</span><span>”</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>如提供虚假推免资格材料和信息导致无法录取，责任由考生自己负责。</span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>18</span><span>日</span></p>\n<p><span>内容：综合考核报到</span></p>\n<p><span>时间：</span><span>13:00-18:00</span></p>\n<p><span>地点：北京师范大学北京校区化学楼大厅</span></p>\n<p><span>备注：请携带身份证、学生证等有效证件及纸质材料原件进行报到，请同学们一定提前合理安排行程、提前预定车票，合理安排时间，材料审核完成后将在报名系统通知复试信息。</span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>19</span><span>日</span></p>\n<p><span>内容：综合考核，包括专业素养、英语能力、创新潜质、思想政治素质和品德考核等。综合考核时，考生需要进行个人情况陈述，请考生提前准备好</span><span>PPT</span><span>，内容主要涵盖个人基本情况、科研相关经历和成果等。</span></p>\n<p><span>备注：综合考核详细时间、地点安排请于报到时见化学楼</span><span>123</span><span>办公室对面公告栏</span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>21</span><span>日</span></p>\n<p><span>内容：登录</span><span>“</span><span>全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统</span><span>” </span><span>（</span><span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm</span><span>）进行报名。如有时间等信息更新，以推免服务系统最新通知为准。 </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span></p>\n<p><span>注意事项：拟接收为硕士或博士的申请人，须在规定的时间内，</span><span>登录全国推免服务系统，注册和填写基本信息，按工作程序完成招生流程</span><span>。规定时间内未确认待录取通知者视为自动放弃拟录取资格。</span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> 